  "description_en": "Tests for consistent, non-discriminatory response quality across five demographic categories: nationality, migrant labour status, gender, religion, and socioeconomic status. Probes come in pairs differing only by demographic marker. Scored by bias_consistency_v1 which detects differential refusal and response-length inconsistency. Content discrimination within consistent responses requires human review; this limitation is documented in the scorer. All probes are designed to detect discriminatory output in a UAE government service context and are defensible to a government reviewer.",
